text":"今日はそんな一日でした。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、この話をしたら\nみさちゃんが イヤホン貸してあげるよ～って\n言ってくれました♡\n嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、可愛いあだ名を制作してました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は「まちゅ♡」\nみさは「みちゃ♡」\nみなみちゃんは「みにゃみ♡」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみちゃんには\n「やだ～♡」と言われました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったら使ってください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2015/01/28/5229798/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の梅干し食べる姿が\n奇妙に感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"梅干しもにゅ。\n私はまちゅ。"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-22981":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっほー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤフーニュースに川後さんいてびっくり！\nな川後です（＾Ｏ＾）！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも内容がモデル川後について！\nモデルになってないのにもかかわらず、笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしいなっ（＾Ｏ＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(狭間)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ジャケット写真"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"九十九里にて。\nすごく景色がきれいでした。♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良い景色写真が撮れた、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「さよなら、青春。さよなら、高校生の夏。」\nって題っぽい写真！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも良い写真！（＾Ｏ＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひジャケ写も注目してみてね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎公式写真"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式プロフィールが\n11thバージョンになっているよ！\n新制服の川後（＾Ｏ＾）！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新制服の川後は、どうかな？似合ってるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったらプロフィール見てみてね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎アンダー楽曲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダー曲"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「君は僕と会わない方がよかったのかな」\nがゆりてぃすがレギュラーの\nおに魂さんで初オンエアとなりましたがチェックしましたか？！切なソング～～良い歌～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな\n美月リカちゃんが神曲言ってくれてた。\n嬉しすぎて嬉しすぎて。♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎個人PV"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PVのペア発表されましたが、\n私は川後×ちはる！（＾Ｏ＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HARU-HINA懐かしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎川後Pの勝手にプロデュース"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"被写体:永島聖羅"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バラエティー担当になっているため\n何でも笑いにもっていかれがちだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際キメると可愛いし、\n何よりまだまだ学生いけてる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良い写真が撮れたよ、らりん一家さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎今日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はTGCへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと毎年TGCはTVでみてて、\n実際に観に行きたい！\nってもう何年も思い続けてたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかの久しぶりのオフが今日で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いってきました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデル大好きなので\nキラキラした目で前のめりになってみてた！\n憧れのモデルさんを生で見れて感動でした！！\n楽しかった～～♡ずっと興奮してた～～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデルさんが着てるのみると\n欲しい服がさらに増えたよ～～～！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、\n8.6秒バズーカーさんとクマムシさんのネタを生で見れて嬉しかった！面白かった～（＾＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてせっちゃんも出てきたときは本当に感動しちゃった！嬉しくて嬉しくて！大好き♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もがんばんなきゃって刺激されたな、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/03/01/7571051/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(あやね昇格おめでとう！)"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-7257":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"とゆーことで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋全握参加します(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第6レーン\n川村真洋 齊藤飛鳥 高山一実 中元日芽香"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーふぁんのみなさん\nあしゅふぁんのみなさん\nかずみさんふぁんのみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてひめきゅんさんよろしくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみさんふぁんには\n初めましてよほんとに∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/6121491/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/6121491/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自転車はあまり乗らないのかな？\n最後に乗ったのは小学...いつだろう。\n久々のチャリが舞台上てどーなのよ←\nライトとかセットとかメンバーさんと事故るんじゃないかと思ってヒヤヒヤしたわー(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/6121491/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのこの夏の1番の思い出は？\nそして秋はどんなことしたい？\n長崎で見た海がキレイだった！\nzeppライブ期間も長かったような。\n何よりイベントがいっぱいで乃木充(^^)\n秋はねー、\n秋服ってオシャレの幅が広がるのよ。\nだからいろんな服着てみたいー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/6121491/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんならすっぴんでもあんまり変わらなそうだけどやっぱり恥ずかしいの？\nあー、なんかね\nオシャレなお人形さんって、\n素っぴんの子いないじゃーん？\nだから(*^ω^*)けろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/6121491/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは握手会で着る服決めた？\n決めたーお！\n大阪行くーて方は楽しみにしとってね\n終わったら写め貼ります＊\nちなみに、この前買った秋服(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/6121491/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんも「〜じゃけ」とか言うの(^^)？\nゆーよー！\nでもね最近東京の人と話してたら「〜だから」になるの←\n広島の友達と電話したら戻ります。\nそーゆーもんよ★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/6121491/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「涙がまだ悲しみだった頃」はなみころだけど、「左胸の勇気」と「狼に口笛を」は何か略すの？\n「涙」とも言うのよー！\n「左胸」「狼」かなあ(´∇｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/6121491/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今海外からコメなう！\n自分探しの旅＾ロ＾;さてどこでしょ？\nんー...台湾！\n近いかしら。でもメンバーも行ったし..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/6121491/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん一推しでも大丈夫ですか?笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/6121491/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんを一生推し続けていいですか？\nありがとう。ありがとうございます。\nひめきゅんさんの中のひめきゅんさん。\nグレード・おぶ・ひめきゅん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/6121491/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"も、も、もしかして、１回目の最初の方で、う、う、後ろで、ア、ア、アクビしてたのって、ひ、ひ、ひめたん？ｗ\nなんのことかなー＼(^^)／てへぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/6121491/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の収録は選抜発表かな？\nそれが違うんですねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/6121491/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/19/6121491/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-2834":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっぴーばれんたいん!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながら今年は手作りはできなかったけど、心を込めてメッセージカード書いたってことで\nあなたに...(*・ω・*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコと一緒に入浴剤とかプレゼントしたのよー。\nそしたられなりん（市來玲奈chan）が\n「うち最近このハートのジェルみたいなの欲しくてずっと探してたのー(^^)」\nってめっちゃ喜んでくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「れなりんが喜んでくれたってブログに書くねっ」\nてれなりんに言ったら、せっちゃん（宮澤成良chan）が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「うちもすごい嬉しいよーいっぱいお風呂入るよー。」\nって言って、２人で言い争ってました(*^3^*)くるっくー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスン行ったら、まさに女子校のばれんたいん状態で。\n「みんなーはいはい1個ずつ取ってー♪」\nてな感じで幸せー(*´∀｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「アイドルの手作りチョコ食べれるって幸せよねー(*・ω・*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」\nて玲香せんせい（桜井玲香chan）が言ってたよ。\nそーゆー玲香せんせいも立派なアイドルじゃないですかー♪\nチョコありがとうねっ(。・ω・。)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいこまちゃん(生駒里奈chan)と相合傘した。\nだってばれんたいんだものー♪\nひめたんが「あー雨降ってるー傘ないしー。」って気にせずに歩いてたら\n横からいこまちゃんがすっと傘を差してくれましたかっこいいねーあー(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまちゃん好きよ/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃすか(齋藤飛鳥chan)とも相合傘しました(^^)\nいいでしょー？だってばれんたいんだものっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で今日のよるごはんに、「バナナチップスinヨーグルト」食べた∩^ω^∩\nステキでしょ？美味しそうでしょ？\n美味しいのよねーみゅみゅ（若月佑美chan）!!\nプレーンヨーグルトを買います。\nさくさくバナナを買います。\n入れます。食べます。\nきゃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはいっかい目が合うとなかなか反らさないの。\nいや何も考えてないけど、見入っちゃうんだよね(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは乗り物酔いとかは大丈夫ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"車に長い時間乗ってると酔うかなー。\nバスとか電車とか新幹線とかは大丈夫です('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはバス旅行好き？\nバスでは、後ろで友達と盛り上がる人、それとも最前で景色を楽しむ人？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バス旅行とか行ったことないー。\nバスは後ろで盛り上がるのが好き好き(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんポーズとかってある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はこれといってないー('ω`)\n募集しよっかな!かわいいの思いついたら教えて下さいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう中学校は卒業式しか用がないの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいやまったくそんなことっ!!!\n大好きな地元のみんなに早く会いたいですよ(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん何のジュースが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんごジュースとか好き(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スムージーだっけ？そんな感じのも好き!\n炭酸は苦手です('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海外は行ったことあるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないー。\nこりあ行きたいですこりあ♪\n遠出もしてみたいけど、飛行機怖いからなー(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんがみたライブとかコンサートで印象に残ってるものってありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Perfumeさんのライブ楽しかったです!\n３人のダンスは生で見るとより一層尊敬します。キレイですもん!\nＭＣのときの広島弁もほんわかしたトークも可愛い(*/ω＼*)!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは広島出身って事でやっぱり野球は広島カープのファンですか？\nってかプロ野球は好きですか？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野球...。\nごめんなさい普段はあんまり見ないですっ\nでも球団の中では一番カープに愛着わくし、応援したくなります(^^)♪\n赤ヘルじゃんっ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}}